<title>INDIA: India's IFCI cuts prime rate to 14.5 pct.</title>
<headline>India's IFCI cuts prime rate to 14.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Industrial Finance Corp of India Ltd (IFCI) said on Tuesday it cut its prime lending rate for rupee loans for fixed rate lending to 14.5 percent from 15 percent.</p>
<p>It said the reduction took effect from July 1.</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
